<title>USA: BASEBALL-SUNDAY'S LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES RESULT.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-SUNDAY'S LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Major League</p>
<p>Baseball playoff game on Sunday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	  American League Championship Series</p>
<p> New York	  6   BALTIMORE	 4</p>
<p>(New York wins best-of-seven-games series 4-1)</p>
<p>	  National League Championship Series</p>
<p> ST LOUIS	  at   Atlanta	</p>
<p>(St Louis leads best-of-seven series 2-1)</p>
</text>
